# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variable template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development (that file is
# gitignored and must NEVER be committed). In production, set these same
# keys in your host's dashboard (e.g. Vercel → Project → Settings → Env Vars).
#
# Real values do not belong in this file — only placeholders.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GitHub — powers /api/contributions (contribution graph).
# Create a token at https://github.com/settings/tokens
# A classic PAT with `read:user` (or a fine-grained token with read access)
# is enough for public contribution data. Never expose this client-side.
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here
GITHUB_USERNAME=your_github_username_here
